WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.792
The silver drive cam turns with the dial.

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:03.625
The pin on the cam catches the copper lug on the near wheel and pushes it round.

00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:06.708
The far wheel stays at the first number as the dial turns back.

00:00:06.708 --> 00:00:09.208
The middle wheel stops at the second number. The near wheel can still turn.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.583
The last wheel lines up. All three notches are under the fence.

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:12.000
The wheels stay still as the pocket in the cam comes round to the tip of the lever.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.042
The fence drops into the wheel gates. The tip of the lever, called the nose, fits into the cam pocket.

00:00:13.042 --> 00:00:16.833
The turning cam pulls the lever and bolt back together.

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:20.000
The bolt is clear of the frame and the door swings open.
